---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="lg:pb-32 pb-16 relative">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="lg:mb-16 text-center max-w-3xl mr-auto mb-12 ml-auto">
                <h2 class="lg:text-5xl text-4xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope mb-6">
                    Take Full Control Over Global Payroll Operations
                </h2>
                <p class="leading-relaxed text-xl font-light text-gray-400 font-manrope">
                    Garna has a unique solution for enterprises with growing teams and entities and compliance requirements that have to be dealt with in different regions. We've built one solid payroll infrastructure platform that makes it possible for large businesses to manage their workforces on a global scale
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
                <article class="group glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/20 bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M3 21h18" />
                            <path d="M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14" />
                            <path d="M9 21v-6h6v6" />
                            <path d="M9 9h.01" />
                            <path d="M15 9h.01" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white font-manrope">Centralizing payroll across countries and entities</h3>
                    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope">
                        With Garna, you can deal with multiple countries, subsidiaries, and workforce setups from different places from one global payroll dashboard
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="group glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/20 bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M12 2v4" />
                            <path d="M12 18v4" />
                            <path d="m4.93 4.93 2.83 2.83" />
                            <path d="m16.24 16.24 2.83 2.83" />
                            <path d="M2 12h4" />
                            <path d="M18 12h4" />
                            <path d="m4.93 19.07 2.83-2.83" />
                            <path d="m16.24 7.76 2.83-2.83" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white font-manrope">Making payroll scalable and automated</h3>
                    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope">
                        Garna's solution makes automated processing, approvals, invoices, contractor payments and other processes run smoother
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="group glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/20 bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.68 0C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z" />
                            <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white font-manrope">Staying on top of global compliance</h3>
                    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope">
                        Garna helps companies stay on top of ever-changing rules and regulations with automated tax rules handling, regulatory compliance, audit-ready records and keeping track of compliance across different countries
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="group glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-5 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-[#5EA500]/20 bg-[#5EA500]/10 text-[#5EA500] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                            <rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2" />
                            <path d="M8 8V6a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2" />
                            <path d="M8 14h.01" />
                            <path d="M12 14h.01" />
                            <path d="M16 14h.01" />
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white font-manrope">Having everything in one place</h3>
                    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope">
                        Manage payroll operations, approvals, reporting, contractor payments, global workflows, and multi-currency payroll from one intuitive system
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
